        style 33 fill:#85bbf0,stroke:#5d82a8,color:#000000
        34["<div style='font-weight: bold'>PIO simulator and host models</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: pio_sim.py, ide_host_model.py, mdma_host_model.py]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Runs the real pioasm output<br />against PIO-mode and MDMA<br />host models, holding the<br />programs to ATA's timings<br />(pytest -m sim, no hardware).</div>"]
